-- Canonical sample data for the one hardcoded team, per CONTEXT.md "Sample data"
-- (see https://github.com/cyrilleulmi/spongecoach/issues/10). Covers the per-line
-- overview slice: Lines + Rosters, the shared Skill/Development-goal/Focus catalogs,
-- realistic (deliberately non-uniform) n:n associations to Lines, and 0-100 Ratings
-- on Line-Skill associations. Iteration/Event/Focus-attachment seed rows land with
-- their schema in https://github.com/cyrilleulmi/spongecoach/issues/12.
--
-- Catalog content is German (the team's language); the domain *terms* stay English
-- per docs/glossary.md. Fixed UUIDs by kind: 1=line, 2=player, 3=skill,
-- 4=development_goal, 5=focus.

